<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois as outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said analyst James MacGregor resumed coverage of Owens-Illinois Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
